1
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,960
They call them small businesses.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,440
But there is nothing small about what they carry.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,100
Before daybreak, orders move.

4
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,820
Materials cross cities.

5
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:15,960
Decisions shape everything.

6
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,060
Yet no one can see the whole.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,720
An order becomes a message.

8
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:25,000
A delay becomes a habit.

9
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,640
A critical process becomes someone's memory.

10
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:31,100
The most advanced companies build technology around their operation.

11
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:34,880
Growing companies are told to work around the technology.

12
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,500
We believe that should change.

13
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,420
We start with the operation.

14
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:44,000
We measure it.

15
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:46,100
We make loss visible.

16
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:48,120
Then we build around the business.

17
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:51,880
Growth should not make a company harder to see.

18
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:54,040
It should reveal what it can become.

19
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:55,800
Blyndtek.

20
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,660
See the company you're becoming.
